\title "8. Triplets and other tuplets"
\ts (4 4)
r.1{txt "Tab view. 1. Press N, then Shift+4: eighths. 2. Press ; (semicolon) and pick 3 in the Tuplet panel: tuplet entry is on. 3. Type 0, Right arrow key, 2, Right arrow, 3, Right arrow: three eighths in the time of two, under a 3. 4. Press ; and pick None: tuplet entry ends. 5. Type 5, Right arrow, then Esc."} |
r.1 |
5.3.4
  7.3.4{txt "6. Press this 7, then ; and pick 3: the beat turns into a triplet: the 7 is its first eighth, a rest the rest of it."}
  5.3.4 7.3.4 |

